# Bangladesh: 8 divisions (admin1), 64 districts (admin2) and towns, with Bangla names.
# Codes and current romanisations follow ISO 3166-2:BD (2020 spelling update).
#
# kind|code|English name|Bangla names (;)|other spellings (;)|parent code
#
# Divisions match only as "<name> Division" / "<বাংলা> বিভাগ", never by the bare name.
# Districts match as "<name> District" / "<বাংলা> জেলা", and by the bare name unless a town
# row below (the district headquarters) owns the bare name.
